.TH XD\-POLKIT 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-polkit \- the XeonDesktop polkit authentication agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-polkit
.OP \-\-process pid
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-polkit
is the session's polkit authentication agent.
When a program asks for something only an administrator may do (rename
the computer, change the time, mount a disk, install a package...),
polkit asks the agent of the user's session to confirm it, and
.B xd\-polkit
asks in a Windows XP-style Run As dialog: the reason, whose password
(when several administrators qualify) and the password, which polkit's
own helper checks through PAM.
.PP
.BR xd\-compositor (1)
starts it with the session and restarts it if it crashes.
If another agent already serves the session (in a nested session, the
host desktop's), it exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-process " pid"
Serve only the process
.I pid
rather than the whole login session, as
.B pkttyagent \-\-process
does; for testing beside another desktop's agent.
.SH EXIT STATUS
1 when it is not in a login session or can't register as the agent.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR polkit (8),
.BR pkexec (1),
.BR xd\-compositor (1)
